{
    "name": "synthetic-entity-status-unavailable",
    "description": "SYNTHETIC (no Lev8 key was available on 2026-10-16): shape from docs.lev8.com/openapi.yaml and Lev8's response structs; values are placeholders. Replace via `deno task record` when LEV8_API_KEY exists. status answers 503 mid-task: a failed lookup, not a finished task — the poll throws (retriable) instead of settling.",
    "calls": [
